			"Message": "chore(Grove): Remove obsolete snake_case transport stubs\n\nDelete the old GrpcTransport.rs and IpcTransport.rs stub files that were redirecting to the canonical PascalCase modules (gRPCTransport and IPCTransport). These stub files were kept temporarily during the PascalCase migration to maintain backward compatibility while consumers were updated. Now that all consumers have been migrated to use the new module names, the stubs can be safely removed.\n\nThis completes the transport layer cleanup following the PascalCase migration.",
			"SHA": "d7669b11f07f7f59e9f609104474179d9111f062"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-04T08:22:12Z",
			"File": [
				"⣿⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				29,
				6
			],
			"Message": "feat(Project): implement full VS Code extension host API across Element submodules\n\nComplete the VS Code API shim layer across 6 Element submodules enabling native extension support:\n\n- **Air**: PascalCase naming refactor for transport identifiers\n- **Cocoon**: Full dialog API (showInformationMessage, showQuickPick, showInputBox, withProgress, createTerminal) and complete vscode.languages namespace with 25+ provider registrations\n- **Common**: Transport layer PascalCase migration + 15 new language feature provider methods and ActionEffect modules\n- **Grove**: Transport layer PascalCase migration + extended LanguageNamespace with full vscode.languages API surface\n- **Mountain**: Extended Vine gRPC protocol with extension host service definitions (language features, window ops, file system, output channels, tasks, authentication, terminals)\n\nThis enables VS Code extensions running in Cocoon to access native OS dialogs, progress reporting, terminal integration, and full language server protocol support via Mountain gRPC.",
			"SHA": "c12f133ec928a6065637a9c22b8981f7c2339e69"
		},
