				"⣿⡿⠀⠀⠀",
				29,
				11
			],
			"Message": "docs(Element): benefit-focused README rewrite across all submodules\n\nUpdate documentation across 11 Element submodules (Air, Common, Echo, Grove, Maintain, Mountain, Output, Sky, Vine, Wind, Worker) to use benefit-focused language and self-hosted brand assets.\n\nChanges include:\n- Replace verbose technical documentation with problem/solution narrative opening\n- Condense feature lists into concise bullet points emphasizing developer outcomes\n- Remove detailed architecture tables, code examples, and deep dive sections\n- Switch vendor badge icons from external CDN (simpleicons.org) to self-hosted editor.land SVGs\n- Streamline See Also links to point to editor.land documentation\n\nThis aligns all Element READMEs with the marketing website's goal-oriented copy direction, improving developer onboarding by leading with the \"why\" before the \"how\".",
			"SHA": "75ae7390b4043df900875b2924ec07efab334b3a"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-04T07:16:54Z",
