			"Message": "docs(Project): benefit-focused documentation rewrite across all Element submodules\n\nUpdate documentation across all Element submodules (Air, Cocoon, Common, Echo, Grove, Maintain, Mist, Mountain, Output, Rest, SideCar, Sky, Vine, Wind, Worker) to use benefit-focused language.\n\nReplace technical-spec copy with developer-facing value propositions in Library.rs rustdoc. Rewrite README files from \"X is engineered to\" to \"What X gives you\" — outcome-first copy matching the website's goal-oriented direction. Remove 50-level analysis checklists where present.\n\nThis ensures consistent, user-facing documentation across the entire Land editor architecture, improving developer onboarding and comprehension of each component's value.",
